{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1295","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Same GCDs"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two integers $$$a$$$ and $$$m$$$. Calculate the number of integers $$$x$$$ such that $$$0 \\le x \\lt m$$$ and $$$\\gcd(a, m) = \\gcd(a + x, m)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note: $$$\\gcd(a, b)$$$ is the greatest common divisor of $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the single integer $$$T$$$ ($$$1 \\le T \\le 50$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next $$$T$$$ lines contain test cases — one per line. Each line contains two integers $$$a$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le a \\lt m \\le 10^{10}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$T$$$ integers — one per test case. For each test case print the number of appropriate $$$x$$$-s."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n4 9\n5 10\n42 9999999967\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n1\n9999999966\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case appropriate $$$x$$$-s are $$$[0, 1, 3, 4, 6, 7]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case the only appropriate $$$x$$$ is $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1295D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1295/problem/D"}